Subject: Cantor SJS Staged Diff Acquisition P1 Threat Review

@ [threat_review_uuid] 451a5013-1ed7-40ee-a128-d2511bc7e943

& [Threats]
  + T01 executable substitution after selection
  + T02 repository path substitution or symlink escape
  + T03 ambient Git config external diff or textconv execution
  + T04 credential prompt or lazy network object fetch
  + T05 index mutation during multi-command acquisition
  + T06 branch or HEAD movement during acquisition
  + T07 malformed NUL raw records or score ambiguity
  + T08 submodule gitlink or nonregular mode smuggling
  + T09 copy type-change conflict or unmerged status coercion
  + T10 SHA-1 object locator mistaken for content identity
  + T11 missing object oversized blob stderr or exit truncation
  + T12 generated-refresh classification widening
  + T13 path traversal non-UTF8 duplicate or case ambiguity
  + T14 receipt replay against another executable repository branch or index
  + T15 observation receipt mistaken for mutation or publication authority
  + T16 self-referential machine change-set falsely claimed complete

& [Controls]
  + exact executable raw hash request identity env-clear fixed commands double identity read index double hash strict parser closed status/mode map blob SHA256 bounds and domain receipts
  + explicit observation_only physical_contact true and nonauthority fields
  + P1 excludes machine commit-envelope integration
